<topic id="ai-positron-eclipse-view">
  <title>AI Positron View in Eclipse</title>
  <body>
    <p>The plugin provides access to the <uicontrol>AI Positron</uicontrol> side-view. If the view is
      not displayed, it can be opened by selecting it from <menucascade>
        <uicontrol>Window</uicontrol>
        <uicontrol>Show View</uicontrol>
        <uicontrol>Other</uicontrol>
      </menucascade>.</p>
    <p id="p_apy_mpz_bfc">
      <fig id="fig_e4c_npz_bfc">
        <title>AI Positron for Eclipse</title>
        <image href="../img/ai-positron-view-eclipse.png"/>
      </fig>
    </p>
    <p conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/para1" id="p_zps_3pq_gfc"/>
    <p conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/para2" id="p_uj3_jpq_gfc"/>
    <p conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/para3" id="p_d1w_jpq_gfc"/>
    <p conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/para4" id="p_ark_kpq_gfc"/>
    <p id="p_dtr_2hz_txb">There is also a user drop-down menu on the far-right side of the view's
      header that contains the following:<ul id="ul_jgn_vhz_txb">
        <li id="li_t2x_c3z_txb"><uicontrol>Preferences</uicontrol> - Opens the <xref
            href="ai-positron-eclipse-preferences.dita#ai-positron-eclipse-preferences/section_b5p_y14_wxb"
              ><uicontrol>Oxygen AI Positron</uicontrol> preferences page</xref> where you can
          configure the <uicontrol>AI Positron service address</uicontrol> and provide a
            <uicontrol>Context</uicontrol> for the user that the AI will use to create more relevant
          and personalized responses.</li>
      </ul></p>
    <p conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/para5" id="p_fsh_lpq_gfc"/>
    <p conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/para6" id="p_d3x_lpq_gfc"/>
    <p conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/para7" id="p_v3m_mpq_gfc"/>
    <p>Once the entire response is received from the server, the following actions are available
      under the response:<ul id="ul_jkj_vss_jbc">
        <li conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/li1" id="li_m2n_npq_gfc"/>
        <li conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/li2" id="li_vc1_4pq_gfc"/>
        <li id="li_pqx_xpz_bfc"><uicontrol><image href="../img/AI-Preview16.png"/>Modify Document
            and Review Changes</uicontrol> - Opens the built-in file comparison tool where you to
          review the changes that were inserted in the document. After reviewing the changes, click
            <uicontrol>Accept</uicontrol> to keep the changes or <uicontrol>Reject</uicontrol> to
          revert the changes.</li>
        <li conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/li3" id="li_lrn_4pq_gfc"/>
        <li conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/li4" id="li_gmz_4pq_gfc"/>
      </ul></p>
    <p conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/paraNote1" id="p_nww_qpq_gfc"/>
    <p conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/para8" id="p_pqm_rpq_gfc"/>
    <p conkeyref="reusables-ai-plugin/para9" id="p_n23_spq_gfc"/>
  </body>
</topic>
